OL,3,GNEWSAEnduro champion launches festival
OL,4,Aon home turf
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new adventure and enduro festival is
OL,7,Fset to join the Manx sporting calendar
OL,8,Fthis weekend, led by five-time world
OL,9,Fenduro champion David Knight.
OL,11,FThe Manxman has personally curated the
OL,12,Froutes, drawing on trails he rode
OL,13,Fthroughout his career, including some
OL,14,Fhe used to train for his biggest
OL,15,Fchampionship wins.
OL,17,FOrganisers said the selection includes
OL,18,Fhistoric and lesser-known trails, and
OL,19,Fis suitable for riders of different
OL,20,Fexperience levels.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
